---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "Acquisitions"
description: "A discreet, confidential point of contact for recruitment agency owners considering a sale or strategic partnership with Abatec."
---
<header class="page-header">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="breadcrumb"><a href="{{ '/' | url }}">Home</a> / Acquisitions</p>
    <span class="eyebrow">Acquisitions &amp; Strategic Partnerships</span>
    <h1>Considering the next chapter for your agency?</h1>
    <p>Abatec works with owners of specialist recruitment businesses exploring a sale, merger, or strategic partnership. Every conversation is handled directly by our leadership team, in complete confidence.</p>
  </div>
</header>

<section>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="grid grid--2" style="align-items:flex-start;">
      <div>
        <h2>What we look for</h2>
        <ul class="list-check">
          <li>Specialist agencies in engineering, industrial, civil, IT or adjacent technical sectors</li>
          <li>Established client relationships and a track record of compliant delivery</li>
          <li>Owners seeking either a clean exit, a phased transition, or continued involvement post-sale</li>
          <li>Businesses based in or expanding into the UK South West</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 style="margin-top:2.5rem;">How the process works</h2>
        <div class="timeline">
          <div class="timeline__item">
            <span class="timeline__year">01</span>
            <h3>Confidential introduction</h3>
            <p>An initial, NDA-covered conversation directly with our Managing Director — no broker, no noise.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="timeline__item">
            <span class="timeline__year">02</span>
            <h3>Fit &amp; valuation discussion</h3>
            <p>We explore strategic fit and talk openly about valuation expectations before any formal process begins.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="timeline__item">
            <span class="timeline__year">03</span>
            <h3>Structured due diligence</h3>
            <p>A clear, time-boxed due diligence process with named points of contact on both sides.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="timeline__item">
            <span class="timeline__year">04</span>
            <h3>Completion &amp; transition</h3>
            <p>A transition plan built around your preferred level of ongoing involvement, staff continuity, and client communication.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="form-panel">
        <div class="form-success" id="acquisitions-success" role="status">
          <strong>Thank you.</strong> Your enquiry has been sent directly to our Managing Director and will be treated in complete confidence. We'll respond within one working day.
        </div>
        <form data-demo-form data-success-target="acquisitions-success" novalidate>
          <div class="form-grid">
            <div class="field field--full">
              <label for="acq-name">Full name *</label>
              <input type="text" id="acq-name" name="name" required>
            </div>
            <div class="field">
              <label for="acq-email">Email address *</label>
              <input type="email" id="acq-email" name="email" required>
            </div>
            <div class="field">
              <label for="acq-phone">Phone number</label>
              <input type="tel" id="acq-phone" name="phone">
            </div>
            <div class="field field--full">
              <label for="acq-company">Company name</label>
              <input type="text" id="acq-company" name="company">
            </div>
            <div class="field field--full">
              <label for="acq-message">Tell us about your business *</label>
              <textarea id="acq-message" name="message" required placeholder="Sector focus, approximate turnover, and what you're exploring (sale, merger, partnership)."></textarea>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p class="form-note">All enquiries are received directly by our Managing Director and treated as strictly confidential. We will never contact your staff, clients or candidates as part of this process.</p>
          <button class="btn btn--primary btn--block" type="submit" style="margin-top:1.5rem;">Send a confidential enquiry</button>
        </form>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
